											"text": "Step 4 : Error scenario\nThe user is not connect\n4.1 Display an error message\n4.2: The scenario end\nIn the nominal scenario, the user is already connect"
										},
										{
											"_type": "UMLNoteView",
											"_id": "AAAAAAGgGhJEz7BnIZ4=",
											"_parent": {
												"$ref": "AAAAAAGgGT6+opzIy6g="
											},
											"font": "Arial;13;0",
											"left": 816,
											"top": 440,
											"width": 409,
											"height": 105,
											"text": "Step 8.1 : Error scenario\nThere is no evaluation dosn't exist in the data base\n8.1.1 Display an error message the evaluation dosn't exist\n8.1.2: The scenario end\nIn the nominal scenario, evaluation exist in the data base"
										},
										{
											"_type": "UMLNoteView",
											"_id": "AAAAAAGgGhP26bBxD5I=",
											"_parent": {
												"$ref": "AAAAAAGgGT6+opzIy6g="
											},
											"font": "Arial;13;0",
											"left": 816,
											"top": 568,
											"width": 409,
											"height": 105,
											"text": "Step 8.2 : Error scenario\nThe data is not in the correst format\n8.2.1 Display an error message the data is not in the correst format\n8.2.1: The scenario end\nIn the nominal scenario, the data is in the correst format."
										},
										{
											"_type": "UMLNoteView",
											"_id": "AAAAAAGgH0Xvi1wLL58=",
											"_parent": {
												"$ref": "AAAAAAGgGT6+opzIy6g="
											},
											"font": "Arial;13;0",
											"left": 816,
											"top": 296,
											"width": 409,
											"height": 105,
											"text": "Step 5 : Error scenario\nThere is no answer with the data base\n5.1 Display an error message the data base is out of order\n5.2: The scenario end\nIn the nominal scenario, we have a positive answer"
										}
									]
								}
